Xs(a){return"Hands-on technical leader with "+a+"+ years building scalable mobile apps, platforms and SDKs. Strongest expertise in native Android, Kotlin and Java, with solid Flutter, iOS and Kotlin Multiplatform experience.\n\nArchitecture, code review, mentoring, delivery planning and engineering standards \u2014 with a focus on quality, performance, security and AI-assisted productivity."},
