gXo(){return"\u2022 Refactored a banking NDK SDK from ~50MB to ~6MB while preserving features\n\u2022 Built OCR/liveness framework that cut manual document rejection by ~96%\n\u2022 Led Ads SDK architecture for Magazine Luiza, Netshoes and Zattini\n\u2022 Owned a white-label telematics framework with sensors, GPS and BLE\n\u2022 Author of Compose and SwiftUI for Flutter Developers (2026)"},
