gHR(){return"A comparative guide for developers who already know Flutter and need to work with Jetpack Compose and SwiftUI.\n\nEach concept follows Flutter \u2192 Jetpack Compose \u2192 SwiftUI, focusing on state ownership, element identity, effects, navigation and platform integration \u2014 not just API name mapping.\n\nIndependent edition \xb7 2026 \xb7 Author: Paulo Emilio Rodrigues de Moraes"},
